{"steamAppId":4534960,"description":"WORLD’S WORST AIRLINE IS HIRING!\nYou and your friends are the crew. Your job is to deliver passengers and cargo to their destination. Preferably in one piece. While one of you pilots the plane, the others keep the cabin together, serve the passengers, and deal with whatever goes wrong before it gets much worse. \n\nWELCOME TO BUDGET PREMIUM!\nPassengers expect food, drinks, and a smooth flight. Try to provide at least two of those.\n\nMORE TROUBLE, MORE MONEY!\nBefore takeoff, choose which passengers and cargo to bring onboard. The bigger the payout, the more trouble it usually causes. Some cargo is hard to handle, some passengers are hard to please, and some flights start going wrong before you even leave the ground.\n\nSAFETY IS OUR TOP-3 PRIORITY!\nTrouble can start anywhere onboard. Keep the passengers under control, protect the cargo, and do whatever it takes to stop one problem from turning into a full-blown disaster. Not every solution is elegant, and not every passenger stays onboard.\n\nROUGH AIR AHEAD!\nWeather can turn a normal flight into a disaster. Turbulence and air pockets throw passengers, luggage, and anything else that is loose around the cabin. One bad turn can send the whole plane into chaos.\n\nKEY FEATURES\nOnline co-op with friends\n\nPilot the plane or work inside the cabin\n\nPhysics-based passengers, cargo, and cabin chaos\n\nDynamic weather, turbulence, and air pockets\n\nRisky passengers and high-paying cargo","short_description":"Play in co-op as the crew of the world’s worst airline. Your plane is falling apart, your cargo is illegal, and passenger safety barely makes the list.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534960/7ddef53346afe3e3d4d479dbed740cdb38cfe09a/header.jpg?t=1787132605","developer":"FLEXUS","publisher":"FLEXUS","genre":"Экшены, Приключенческие игры, Инди","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок","Многопользовательская","Кооператив","